  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal involves gable roof extensions to the building. The provisions of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order (2015) (as amended) do not allow external material changes to the scale, massing or character of a building. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the terms of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order (2015) (as amended). ",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal fails to ensure the transport impacts of the development are adequately addressed, due to the overprovision of car parking. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the terms of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA, Paragraph MA.2 (2)(a) of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order (2015) (as amended).",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that all habitable rooms of the dwellinghouses would receive adequate natural light, contrary to the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development)(England) Order 2015 (as amended), Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA, Paragraph MA.2 (2)(f) of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order (2015) (as amended)."
